{"about_the_game":"When you purchase the Sorcery Expansion, you will be able to play with new roles in Room Matches/Solo Matches.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Roles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Occultist: New Action: &quot;Curse&quot;<br></li><li>Elite Jack: New Ability &quot;Insight&quot;<br></li><li>Elite Jack Maniac: New Ability &quot;Insight&quot;</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Action &quot;Curse&quot;</h2>During the night turn, select one player other than yourself to curse. The cursed player will be unable to act during the next day's turn.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Ability &quot;Insight&quot;</h2>Elite Jack can identify who the Jack Maniacs are.<br>Elite Jack Maniac can identify who Jack is.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>The crimes of Jack the Ripper and his accomplices were growing more cunning and brutal each night.<br><br>Amidst this, there was a journalist captivated by the darkness of London, independently pursuing the case. Deeply devoted to the occult, he had secretly mastered forbidden sorcery. With this power in hand, the journalist infiltrated the detectives to uncover the truth and began to pursue Jack.<br><br>Madness echoing through the dark night, and the sorcery attempting to expose it\u2014<br>A new battle is about to begin.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561450?t=1743657797","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561450?t=1743657797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561450/767c3794520627a7d0d8df7db484ef0f6acab07f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743657797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561450/767c3794520627a7d0d8df7db484ef0f6acab07f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743657797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"